        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jeff the Killer: Horror Game</strong> is an atmospheric psychological first-person horror where you must survive in a mysterious abandoned house after being kidnapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar place with no memory of how you got here. Silence fills the air, but you sense someone is hunting you. Jeff is a dangerous and relentless stalker who hears every sound you make and is ready to strike at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house, find notes, and experience flashbacks that slowly reveal the mystery of your kidnapping and the reason you are trapped in this terrifying place. Every detail and object might help uncover the truth — but remember, one mistake could cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to survive by avoiding Jeff, solving puzzles, and making critical decisions that affect the story’s outcome. Depending on your choices and discoveries, you will encounter different endings that reveal more about the dark story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense psychological horror with survival and stealth elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric design creating a constant sense of threat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive exploration with clue hunting and note reading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashbacks that gradually reveal the plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique endings based on your decisions</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jeff the Killer: Horror Game</strong> is an atmospheric psychological first-person horror where you must survive in a mysterious abandoned house after being kidnapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar place with no memory of how you got here. Silence fills the air, but you sense someone is hunting you. Jeff is a dangerous and relentless stalker who hears every sound you make and is ready to strike at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house, find notes, and experience flashbacks that slowly reveal the mystery of your kidnapping and the reason you are trapped in this terrifying place. Every detail and object might help uncover the truth — but remember, one mistake could cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to survive by avoiding Jeff, solving puzzles, and making critical decisions that affect the story’s outcome. Depending on your choices and discoveries, you will encounter different endings that reveal more about the dark story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense psychological horror with survival and stealth elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric design creating a constant sense of threat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive exploration with clue hunting and note reading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashbacks that gradually reveal the plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique endings based on your decisions</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Survive. Run. Look for answers.",
